      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], **the Hub never holds the Anthropic API key in its own process environment**. Here\u0027s how it works:\n\n1. **Reads from a git-ignored file**: A local secrets loader reads the API key from a \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup.\n\n2. **Injects into child process only**: The key is injected only into the environment of spawned child processes (the Ingest agent and Query agent), immediately before those processes start.\n\n3. **Hub process stays clean**: The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated with the credential.\n\nThis design ensures that even if the Hub process is compromised or misbehaves, it cannot leak the Anthropic API key simply by inspecting its own environment variables \u2014 the key exists only in the short-lived child processes that actually use it.",
      "input_tokens": 2572,
